@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 1. Metadados do serviço
GET {{baseUrl}}/info
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Accept: application/json

### 2. Predição válida — Perfil A (classe No, validado no modelo treinado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 34,
  "MonthlyCharges": 56.95,
  "TotalCharges": 1889.5,
  "Contract": "One year",
  "InternetService": "DSL",
  "OnlineSecurity": "Yes",
  "TechSupport": "No",
  "PaymentMethod": "Mailed check"
}

### 3. Predição válida — Perfil B (classe Yes, validado no modelo treinado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": 1,
  "MonthlyCharges": 29.85,
  "TotalCharges": 29.85,
  "Contract": "Month-to-month",
  "InternetService": "DSL",
  "OnlineSecurity": "No",
  "TechSupport": "No",
  "PaymentMethod": "Electronic check"
}

### 4. Entrada inválida — deve retornar HTTP 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/predict
User-Agent: Client-Avaliativo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenure": "invalido",
  "MonthlyCharges": 56.95,
  "TotalCharges": 1889.5,
  "Contract": "One year",
  "InternetService": "DSL",
  "OnlineSecurity": "Yes",
  "TechSupport": "No",
  "PaymentMethod": "Mailed check"
}
